Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.33,0:06:17.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.33,0:06:17.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.94,0:06:20.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  我还想
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.94,0:06:20.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, I am trying to
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.72,0:06:22.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.72,0:06:22.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sleep?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.80,0:06:34.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:34.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.91,0:06:37.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那俩白痴在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.91,0:06:37.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are those two morons?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.30,0:06:54.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:54.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.07,0:06:55.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.07,0:06:55.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.10,0:06:56.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:56.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.72,0:07:03.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  看那些草根
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:03.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, check out those roots
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.92,0:07:06.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在跳舞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:06.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're dancing
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.42,0:07:07.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起学草根
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:07.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do like the roots do
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.87,0:07:10.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跳跳泥土舞  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.87,0:07:10.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and do the dirt dance, baby
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.80,0:07:34.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥家也想玩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:34.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward's house wants to play too
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.40,0:07:36.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:36.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My house
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.40,0:07:45.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥家听着有点像拉肚子了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:45.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward's house sounds like it has an upset tummy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.55,0:07:47.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定是吃了什么不好的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.55,0:07:47.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must have been something that it ate
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.47,0:07:49.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它吃了章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.47,0:07:49.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It ate Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.95,0:07:50.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,合情合理
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:50.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That'd do it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.78,0:07:55.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个小坏蛋果然是幕后黑手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:55.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew you two reprobates were behind this
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.40,0:07:56.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:56.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.15,0:07:57.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们是小坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.15,0:07:57.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're reprobates
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我那是在骂你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was an insult
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.65,0:08:01.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们被骂到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:01.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And we're insulted
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.22,0:08:03.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛要在我家院子底下挖地道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:03.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why were you digging under my yard?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你叫我们不要跑你家院子上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You told us not to walk on your yard
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.91,0:08:07.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就跑你家院子下了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.91,0:08:07.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so we walked under it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.13,0:08:09.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可你们埋了我家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:09.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But you buried my house
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.06,0:08:11.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用谢我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:11.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No need to thank us
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.30,0:08:12.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:12.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.55,0:08:13.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:13.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're welcome
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.52,0:08:16.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没抓到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:16.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Missed
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.22,0:08:18.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有人想玩抓人游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:18.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Somebody wants to play tag
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.80,0:08:19.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抓到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:19.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tag
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.20,0:08:19.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你当鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:19.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.42,0:08:22.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不当鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.42,0:08:22.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward wins
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.71,0:08:46.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:46.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.81,0:08:48.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们要玩一个新游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:48.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're going to play a new game
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.68,0:08:51.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,叫做  把我家挖出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:51.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,called "digging out my house"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.57,0:08:53.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:53.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.69,0:08:57.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而我要玩的是坐着休息
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.69,0:08:57.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna play "sit and relax"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.70,0:08:59.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,玩到你们玩完为止
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:59.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,until you're finished
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.75,0:09:01.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两个呆头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:01.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacle brains
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.67,0:09:23.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:23.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.51,0:09:34.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我警告你们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:34.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.62,0:09:37.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是你们还不把我家放回原处
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:37.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if you don't put my house back where it belongs
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.58,0:09:39.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那么等我数到三
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:39.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,by the count of three
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.80,0:09:43.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:43.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Three
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.52,0:09:45.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就要把你们磨成海霸糊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:45.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am gonna grind you into chum
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.05,0:09:47.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:47.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.96,0:09:49.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他数起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:49.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's counting
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.30,0:09:51.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别数啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:51.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything but counting
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.90,0:09:52.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:52.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quick, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.40,0:09:55.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拼命挖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:55.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dig for your life
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.19,0:09:56.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.19,0:09:56.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Two
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.45,0:09:59.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他已经数到二了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.45,0:09:59.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's already at number two
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.47,0:10:03.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天知道数到三还剩多少个数
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.47,0:10:01.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who knows how many numbers we have
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:03.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,until he reaches three?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.79,0:10:04.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:04.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Three
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.87,0:10:29.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.87,0:10:29.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Scary
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:32.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,392)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:40.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(410,682)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.37,0:10:35.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.37,0:10:35.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.72,0:10:39.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全裤头村就只剩海之霸一家餐厅了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.72,0:10:39.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now the chum bucket is the only restaurant in town
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.37,0:10:43.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:43.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nuts
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.47,0:10:46.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.47,0:10:46.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.28,0:10:48.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:48.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.94,0:10:49.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,挖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:49.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,dig
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.77,0:10:56.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石头太硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.77,0:10:56.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The rock's too hard
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.05,0:11:12.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.05,0:11:12.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.17,0:11:14.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:14.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,two
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.37,0:11:15.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.37,0:11:15.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,morons
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.84,0:11:18.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,害我房子沉没了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:18.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,sunk my house
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.34,0:11:21.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:21.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一定要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:32.33,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1038,856)}裤头村
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.17,0:11:43.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.17,0:11:43.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.75,0:11:47.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村地底又是美好的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.75,0:11:47.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Another bee-eautiful day under bikini bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.82,0:11:51.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我讨厌邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.82,0:11:51.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate neighbors
