Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哒哒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ta-da
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.37,0:12:12.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟你一模一样的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.37,0:12:12.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A gift in your likeness
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你很甜美
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause you're so sweet
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.92,0:12:16.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:16.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为菠萝本来就甜美
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause pineapples are sweet
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.27,0:12:20.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且你也很甜美
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.27,0:12:20.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and you are sweet also as well
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.57,0:12:21.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:21.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.37,0:12:33.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:33.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.81,0:12:36.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你那桶奶酪还有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.81,0:12:36.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You still got that bucket of cheese?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.27,0:12:38.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.27,0:12:38.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.30,0:12:39.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:39.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.45,0:12:41.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.45,0:12:41.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not right
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.65,0:12:42.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:42.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.75,0:12:43.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.75,0:12:43.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll help you
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.71,0:12:49.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.71,0:12:49.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.28,0:12:50.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:50.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.95,0:12:53.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  太谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.95,0:12:53.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, thank you so much
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.30,0:12:55.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不是有你这一身蛮力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:55.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for your tremendous gorilla strength
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.55,0:12:56.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我差点就会完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:56.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would've been a goner
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.85,0:12:59.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么可以回报你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:59.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If there's anything I can do to return the favor--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.36,0:13:01.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,随便什么事都行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:01.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,anything at all--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.62,0:13:02.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尽管说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:02.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you just let me know
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总之我该继续练空手道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anyway, back to my karate exercises
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.00,0:13:07.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奶酪桶里的奶酪随你吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:07.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And help yourself to the cheese bucket
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.33,0:13:09.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再次谢谢了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.33,0:13:09.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks again, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.04,0:13:21.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想学那个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:21.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want to learn how to do that
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.77,0:13:22.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:22.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.28,0:13:23.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是说空手道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:23.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean karate?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.64,0:13:25.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.64,0:13:25.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.73,0:13:27.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  我亲爱的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:27.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, my dear, dear friend
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.60,0:13:31.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,空手道可复杂了  要好几年才能摸清
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:31.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,karate is a delicate art, a skill that takes years to--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.22,0:13:33.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没记错的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:33.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I recall correctly
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.45,0:13:36.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我几分钟前好像还救了你一命呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.45,0:13:36.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I seem to remember saving your life a few minutes ago
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.97,0:13:38.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  但是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:38.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, however--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.13,0:13:40.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且我还记得你说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.13,0:13:40.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I also remember you saying
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.89,0:13:44.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么可以回报我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.89,0:13:44.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if there's anything you can do to return the favor--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.34,0:13:46.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,随便什么事都行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:46.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,anything at all--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.55,0:13:47.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尽管说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.55,0:13:47.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to let you know
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.22,0:13:50.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还真说过  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:50.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I did say that, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.03,0:13:52.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是  空手道重点在技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:52.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but, well, karate is about finesse
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.81,0:13:54.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而不是过度使用蛮力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.81,0:13:54.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not so much brute strength
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.35,0:13:57.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很多门道你都没摸清呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:57.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You see, there's so much you don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.19,0:14:00.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连最皮毛的皮毛都没摸到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:14:00.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You have not even scratched the surface of the surface
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.80,0:14:01.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就教教我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:01.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then teach me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.60,0:14:03.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如你所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.60,0:14:03.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As you wish
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.37,0:14:04.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要记住一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.37,0:14:04.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just remember one thing
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.17,0:14:08.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能力越大  责任就越大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:08.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With power comes responsibility
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.15,0:14:09.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶  万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.15,0:14:09.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, mama
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.24,0:14:12.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先从简单的入手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:12.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's start off simple
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.57,0:14:15.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个基础招式叫  倒立漩涡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:15.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is a basic move called the inverted whirlpool
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.75,0:14:17.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,道理炫锅  明白
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:17.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Invertee whirpee, got it
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.35,0:14:28.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:28.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was awesome
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.93,0:14:29.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你能行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:29.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Think you can handle that?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.97,0:14:30.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能能能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:30.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.48,0:14:41.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:41.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.32,0:14:49.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这要怎么停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:49.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How do you stop this thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.35,0:14:51.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老天啊  那什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:51.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Neptune's trousers, what's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.60,0:14:57.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这招非常简单
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:57.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, this is very easy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.37,0:14:58.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.37,0:14:58.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch closely
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.87,0:15:01.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:01.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.67,0:15:02.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:02.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Definitely
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.32,0:15:14.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  虽然我很不愿意这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:14.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, I didn't want to have to say this
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.88,0:15:15.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:15.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but you're--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.25,0:15:17.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,孺子不可教也
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:17.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're unteachable
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.71,0:15:18.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:18.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.50,0:15:19.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我我我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:19.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I-I-I
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.37,0:15:21.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:21.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacles
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.87,0:15:28.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看你把这块煤渣墙劈成了什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.87,0:15:28.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look what you did to this wall of cinder blocks
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.00,0:15:29.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我训练这么多年来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.00,0:15:29.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In all my years of training
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.36,0:15:31.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就从来没见过这么完美的一劈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:31.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a perfect slice
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.70,0:15:32.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从来就没谁能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:32.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No one's ever been able to
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.61,0:15:35.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么干净利落地劈开煤渣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.61,0:15:35.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,execute such a clean karate chop through solid cinder
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.29,0:15:37.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是天生好手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:37.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're a natural
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.49,0:15:38.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,空手道天才
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.49,0:15:38.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a karate genius
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.83,0:15:39.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:39.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plammo
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.79,0:15:41.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来实践一下你学到的新招
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:41.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now let's put your new skills to the test
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.54,0:15:44.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是磨得非常尖锐的回火钢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:44.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is sharpened tempered steel
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.50,0:15:46.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,劈不开也别沮丧  再试几下就
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:46.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, don't be frustrated if it takes a few tri--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.26,0:15:49.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太神了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:49.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:53.64,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(832,730)}装甲军舰号
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.30,0:15:53.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是一艘废弃熟铁汽船
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:53.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is an abandoned wrought iron steamboat
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.64,0:15:54.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可结实了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:54.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,solid as a rock
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.77,0:15:56.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有没有本事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.77,0:15:56.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Think you got what it takes?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.71,0:16:01.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你下次好运
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:01.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Better luck next time
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.69,0:16:03.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:03.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.52,0:16:05.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我肯定啥都劈得开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:05.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I bet I could chop anything
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.45,0:16:10.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.45,0:16:10.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nooooo
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.80,0:16:11.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我怎么跟你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:11.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.75,0:16:13.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.75,0:16:13.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a genius?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.72,0:16:15.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是那个  是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:15.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not that, this
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.10,0:16:18.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能力越大  责任就越大
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.10,0:16:18.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With power comes responsibility
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.95,0:16:21.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也就是不能劈其他生命及其财产
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:20.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That means no chopping
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:21.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of other life-forms or their property
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.75,0:16:22.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听懂了没
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:22.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.71,0:16:23.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:23.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yyyes
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.67,0:16:24.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:24.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.35,0:16:27.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完了  上班要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.35,0:16:27.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I'm late for work
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.25,0:16:28.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:28.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you later, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.30,0:16:30.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了我说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:30.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't forget what I said
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.10,0:16:30.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:30.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.50,0:16:33.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.50,0:16:33.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a genius
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.56,0:16:40.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,空手道超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:40.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karate power
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:43.89,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(374,432)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:47.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1042,774)}现代针织
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.44,0:16:45.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.44,0:16:45.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.73,0:16:46.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以前从来没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:46.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen this before
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.95,0:16:47.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.95,0:16:47.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.92,0:16:49.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看  是派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:49.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, it's Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.75,0:16:50.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好啊  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:50.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hiya, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.02,0:16:51.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你来干啥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:51.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing--
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.16,0:16:56.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海神王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:56.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dear Neptune
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.41,0:16:57.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先生们好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:57.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good day, gents
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.78,0:16:59.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  我想要个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:16:59.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, I would like a
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.57,0:17:02.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.57,0:17:02.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A what?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.58,0:17:05.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说来份蟹堡套餐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:05.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said one krusty combo
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.07,0:17:06.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就不会空手道语吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.07,0:17:06.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you speak karate?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.12,0:17:15.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看着就好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:15.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks delish
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.28,0:17:16.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你不觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:16.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, don't you think
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.20,0:17:18.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这完美一劈有些太过头了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:18.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're taking your perfect slice a bit too far?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.75,0:17:20.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不懂你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.75,0:17:20.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.89,0:17:24.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有你才管我叫空手道天才
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.89,0:17:24.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were the one who called me a karate gen-i-us
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.42,0:17:28.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说实话  你先前的指责冒犯到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.42,0:17:28.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And frankly, I'm offended by your previous accusation
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.05,0:17:29.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不受这气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.05,0:17:29.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't need this
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.42,0:17:31.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就此分别吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:31.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I bid you good-dieu
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.28,0:17:31.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:31.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.11,0:17:32.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别可是了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:32.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No buts
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.87,0:17:34.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,手才配说话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.87,0:17:34.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just hands
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.61,0:17:41.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道那些都得从你工资扣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.61,0:17:41.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You do realize I'm taking that out of your paycheck
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.00,0:17:46.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:46.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.09,0:17:47.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海草惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:47.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Seaweed surprise
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.35,0:17:49.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:49.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Also, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.52,0:17:51.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麦芽珊瑚酥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:51.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Malted coral crunch
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.80,0:17:57.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有多脂奶油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:57.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Also, lipids and cream
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.45,0:17:58.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都卖光了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:17:58.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're all out
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.57,0:18:00.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实所有口味全卖光了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:00.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In fact, we're out of everything
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:02.97,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(274,820)}小费罐
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.10,0:18:03.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以要付八十六块五
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:03.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,which means you owe us $86.50
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.77,0:18:07.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以物易物行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.77,0:18:07.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you say to a trade?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.94,0:18:10.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再不付钱我就报警了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:10.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I say pay up before I call the cops
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.23,0:18:13.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我以物易物你还敢不要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:13.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You dare refuse my barter?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.00,0:18:15.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就吃我一劈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:15.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then accept my chop
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.77,0:18:31.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.77,0:18:31.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't feel so good
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.01,0:18:34.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又偷小费了是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:34.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hand in the tip jar again, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.47,0:18:46.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那股美妙的臭气是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.47,0:18:46.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is that wonderful stench?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.20,0:18:49.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:49.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What you got there?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.39,0:18:52.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鱿鱼酱菠菜巧克力意大利面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.39,0:18:52.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spinach and chocolate spaghetti in calamari sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.51,0:18:53.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要来一口吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.51,0:18:53.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you want a bite?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.46,0:18:54.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:54.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.57,0:18:56.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,劈劈更好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:18:56.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's more fun to chop
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:00.20,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(740,158)}裤头村游戏厅
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.30,0:19:03.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:03.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I win
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.77,0:19:09.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:09.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.73,0:19:11.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到处乱劈的疯子四处出没
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:11.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a mad chopper on the loose
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.17,0:19:12.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到处乱劈的疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:12.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mad chopper?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.07,0:19:13.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.07,0:19:13.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.90,0:19:15.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得报警啊  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.90,0:19:15.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We need the cops, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.42,0:19:16.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,报警
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:16.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cops?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.20,0:19:17.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没那个必要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:17.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, that won't be necessary
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.47,0:19:18.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来搞定  市民
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.47,0:19:18.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this, citizen
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.77,0:19:19.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,千万别  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.77,0:19:19.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.80,0:19:22.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放开我的脚踝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:22.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unhand my ankle, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.12,0:19:23.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我朋友需要我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:23.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My friend needs me
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.57,0:19:24.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不知自己在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:24.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're doing
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.80,0:19:26.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别走出那扇门
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:26.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't walk out that door
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.28,0:19:29.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:29.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Noooooooooooo
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.56,0:19:35.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:35.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.05,0:19:36.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.05,0:19:36.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.17,0:19:37.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我正要找你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.17,0:19:37.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just the man I was looking for
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.10,0:19:39.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很想谢谢你  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:39.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wanted to thank you, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.02,0:19:43.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,教会了我空手道啊  傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:43.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For teaching me the karate chop, silly
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.37,0:19:45.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要住手啊  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:45.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've got to stop, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.05,0:19:46.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你把全裤头村都毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:46.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're destroying the entire town
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.85,0:19:53.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别劈了好吗  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.85,0:19:53.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just stop chopping, okay, Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.25,0:19:54.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:54.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got it, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.62,0:19:56.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能再打空手道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:56.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No more karate chops
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.71,0:20:00.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还在劈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.71,0:20:00.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're still chopping
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.32,0:20:01.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.32,0:20:01.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Weird, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.55,0:20:03.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  住手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.55,0:20:03.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, stop it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.45,0:20:05.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.45,0:20:05.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.71,0:20:06.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.71,0:20:06.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.37,0:20:09.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要用乱劈阻止乱劈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:09.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll stop a chop with a chop
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.34,0:20:13.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要抵抗住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.34,0:20:13.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You must resist
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.12,0:20:13.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:13.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.82,0:20:22.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:22.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.25,0:20:24.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.25,0:20:24.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Triton's tunic
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:32.33,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(862,366)}便宜货超市
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.02,0:20:26.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他朝便宜货超市过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:26.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's headed straight for the barg'n-mart
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.69,0:20:33.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.69,0:20:33.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.74,0:20:36.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别劈松糕展品啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:36.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not the muffin display
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.09,0:20:42.72,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(706,310)}裤头村新闻
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.27,0:20:38.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚收到的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.27,0:20:38.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This just in
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.38,0:20:40.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一名疯子正在到处乱劈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:40.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A madman is chopping everything
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.40,0:20:42.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别劈大屏幕电视啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:42.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not the giant-screen tvs
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.32,0:20:44.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:44.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.04,0:20:49.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嫌疑人是粉红胖子  且非常危险
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:49.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The suspect is considered fat, pink, and dangerous
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.03,0:20:50.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.03,0:20:50.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.30,0:20:51.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更大的电视
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:51.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gianter tvs
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.57,0:20:55.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冷静一点  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.57,0:20:55.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pull it together, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.90,0:20:59.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我尽力了  可这东西有自我意识了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:59.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to, but this thing has a mind of its ooooown
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.25,0:21:15.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:15.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.70,0:21:16.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.70,0:21:16.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.80,0:21:18.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:18.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.99,0:21:20.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.99,0:21:20.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebo--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.40,0:21:22.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:22.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:23.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1054,266)}绵块
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.72,0:21:25.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:25.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.76,0:21:28.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我  我对不起你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:28.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.49,0:21:30.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.49,0:21:30.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My best friend
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.07,0:21:32.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被残垣断壁压烂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.07,0:21:32.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,crushed by all this rubble
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.35,0:21:37.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,埋葬在这个便宜塑料包装里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:37.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,entombed in this cheap plastic bag
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.40,0:21:39.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那不是你朋友  你个呆头
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:39.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That isn't your friend, you kelp for brains
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.80,0:21:41.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是清洁用海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:41.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those are cleaning sponges
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.00,0:21:44.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我没压死我全世界最好的朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:43.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I haven't crushed the life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.53,0:21:44.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,out of my best friend in the world?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.67,0:21:46.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那可不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.67,0:21:46.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.69,0:21:50.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.69,0:21:50.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.27,0:21:51.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.27,0:21:51.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.92,0:21:59.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我无法原谅我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:59.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive myself
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.50,0:22:00.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.50,0:22:00.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.79,0:22:02.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我绝对不能原谅你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.79,0:22:02.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.62,0:22:10.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.62,0:22:10.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.07,0:22:11.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我错过什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.07,0:22:11.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did I miss?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.89,0:22:13.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你没事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.89,0:22:13.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, you're okay
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.81,0:22:14.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.81,0:22:14.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.55,0:22:16.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的胳膊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.55,0:22:16.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your arm
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.52,0:22:17.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.52,0:22:17.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.93,0:22:18.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可是海星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.93,0:22:18.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a sea star
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.28,0:22:20.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,四肢会再生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:20.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My limbs grow back
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.73,0:22:21.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.73,0:22:21.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.42,0:22:23.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再生万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.42,0:22:23.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hooray for regeneration
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.50,0:22:26.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本着把治愈进行到底的精神
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:26.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And in the spirit of healing
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.20,0:22:30.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我发誓只用我的双手把东西组装回去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:30.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I vow to use my hands only to join things together
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.77,0:22:32.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就从这里开始
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:32.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,starting here
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.44,0:22:34.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:34.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great job, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.04,0:22:36.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,建筑细节我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:36.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like the architectural detail
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.73,0:22:38.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:38.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.71,0:22:40.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不是不劈了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.71,0:22:40.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought you gave up chopping
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.80,0:22:41.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:41.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I did
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.80,0:22:44.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜我们海星的四肢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.80,0:22:44.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we sea stars have limbs
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.40,0:22:45.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也会再生出新身体
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.40,0:22:45.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that grow new bodies
